{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/7pgzbv","slideIndex":0,"text":"Opening\nSpeaker: Raghav\nTarget: 20 seconds\n\nGood morning. We are Raghav Nargotra and Siddharth Gupta. Our project is Legal-Setu, a multilingual application for legal intake and advocate access. I handled the backend, and Siddharth handled the frontend. We will follow the P.R.O.J.E.C.T sequence, beginning with the problem. Siddharth will explain it.\n\nEvidence:\nC:/Users/DELL/Vakil-Setu/rebuild/README.md"}
