{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/d1st21","slideIndex":1,"text":"P — Problem\nSpeaker: Siddharth\nTarget: 40 seconds\n\nA person may know what happened in a dispute but struggle to identify the relevant legal area or prepare for a consultation. Formal vocabulary and long forms can add difficulty, especially when the person prefers Hindi or Punjabi. Search results and personal referrals can help, but the user still has to organise the facts and arrange a consultation separately. Legal-Setu connects those initial steps in one workflow. This is our problem hypothesis, and we still need user research to measure how widespread it is. Raghav will explain why we chose it.\n\nEvidence:\nC:/Users/DELL/Vakil-Setu/rebuild/docs/requirements.md\nC:/Users/DELL/Vakil-Setu/rebuild/docs/srs-source.txt"}
