{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/7z235f","slideIndex":9,"text":"T — Takeaway: learning and next steps\nSpeaker: Siddharth\nTarget: 35 seconds\n\nOur main learning is that review, consent, and failure handling matter as much as the interface. If we repeated the project, we would involve pilot users earlier and test comprehension alongside technical behaviour. Next, we will validate the complete consultation journey and review the pilot languages with fluent speakers. AI needs the actual gateway contract and approved data terms before real case analysis. Legal-Setu demonstrates the intake foundation, and the next stage is validation in practice. Thank you.\n\nEvidence:\nC:/Users/DELL/Vakil-Setu/rebuild/docs/verification.md\nC:/Users/DELL/Vakil-Setu/rebuild/docs/operations.md\nC:/Users/DELL/Vakil-Setu/rebuild/docs/requirements.md"}